{"key": "[\"From Kandahar to Karnataka, in Prakrit, Greek and Aramaic, the emperor speaks from the rock. In 1837 James Prinsep reads the Brahmi script, and the voice returns. But the edicts call him by a title, Devanampiya Piyadasi. His own name, Ashoka, is found on a rock at Maski only in 1915.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/ashoka-edicts.mp3", "duration": 21.375708, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "From"}, {"t": 0.4191315294117647, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "Kandahar"}, {"t": 0.8382630588235294, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "to"}, {"t": 1.257394588235294, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "Karnataka,"}, {"t": 1.6765261176470587, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "in"}, {"t": 2.0956576470588235, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "Prakrit,"}, {"t": 2.514789176470588, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "Greek"}, {"t": 2.9339207058823527, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "and"}, {"t": 3.3530522352941174, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "Aramaic,"}, {"t": 3.7721837647058822, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "the"}, {"t": 4.191315294117647, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "emperor"}, {"t": 4.610446823529411, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "speaks"}, {"t": 5.029578352941176, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "from"}, {"t": 5.448709882352941, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "the"}, {"t": 5.867841411764705, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "rock."}, {"t": 6.2869729411764705, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "In"}, {"t": 6.706104470588235, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "1837"}, {"t": 7.125235999999999, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "James"}, {"t": 7.5443675294117645, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "Prinsep"}, {"t": 7.963499058823529, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "reads"}, {"t": 8.382630588235294, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "the"}, {"t": 8.801762117647058, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "Brahmi"}, {"t": 9.220893647058823, "d": 0.4191315294117647, "w": "script,"}, {"t": 9.640025176